# W5-B R-061: three infantry share a cell (sub-cell spots, FindInfantrySubposition
# FUN_00481090). Six GIs spawned one per cell are selected with real clicks and
# ordered to one cell: they pack three to a cell on the right/left/down spots
# instead of fanning out one per cell.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click combo:ai1
click "pick:Easy Enemy"
click check:crates
click slider:speed=3
click start
until 120 scene == game
require subcells == 1
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
cheat spawn E1 0 building 0:GACNST +5 +4
cheat spawn E1 0 building 0:GACNST +6 +4
cheat spawn E1 0 building 0:GACNST +7 +4
cheat spawn E1 0 building 0:GACNST +5 +5
cheat spawn E1 0 building 0:GACNST +6 +5
cheat spawn E1 0 building 0:GACNST +7 +5
wait 2
assert max_cell_inf(0) == 1
view building 0:GACNST +7 +6
click unit 0:E1:0
click unit 0:E1:1 shift
click unit 0:E1:2 shift
click unit 0:E1:3 shift
click unit 0:E1:4 shift
click unit 0:E1:5 shift
assert selected == 6
click building 0:GACNST +9 +8
until 400 moving(0) == 0
wait 10
assert max_cell_inf(0) == 3                    @R-061:B
assert cells3(0) >= 1                          @R-061:B
# The three in one cell hold three distinct spots (2 right, 3 left, 4 down).
shot packed
# A tank may not drive into a cell with infantry in it; infantry may not
# enter a vehicle's cell (OccupationFlags 0x20).
end
